name: ['Adriana, Captain of the Guard', 'Aggressive Instinct', 'Akiri, Line-Slinger', 'Alms Collector', "Aminatou's Augury", 'Aminatou, the Fateshifter', 'Ancestor Dragon', 'Ancient Excavation', 'Ancient Stone Idol', 'Angelic Guardian', 'Angler Turtle', "Aquitect's Will", 'Arahbo, Roar of the World', 'Arixmethes, Slumbering Isle', 'Armored Whirl Turtle', 'Armory Automaton', 'Ash Barrens', 'Aspect of Wolf', "Atraxa, Praetors' Voice", 'Avatar of Growth', 'Balan, Wandering Knight', "Benefactor's Draught", 'Bloodforged Battle-Axe', 'Bloodline Necromancer', 'Bloodsworn Steward', 'Bloodtracker', 'Boneyard Scourge', 'Boompile', 'Borderland Explorer', 'Boreas Charger', 'Brainwash', 'Breath of Fire', 'Breya, Etherium Shaper', 'Brilliant Plan', 'Brudiclad, Telchor Engineer', 'Bruse Tarl, Boorish Herder', 'Burnt Offering', 'Cao Ren, Wei Commander', 'Cemetery Gate', 'Charging Cinderhorn', 'Cleansing Screech', 'Cloak of Mists', 'Colorful Feiyi Sparrow', 'Confidence from Strength', "Conqueror's Flail", 'Coveted Jewel', 'Crash of Rhino Beetles', 'Crimson Honor Guard', 'Cruel Tutor', 'Crystalline Crawler', 'Curse of Bounty', 'Curse of Disturbance', 'Curse of Opulence', 'Curse of Vengeance', 'Curse of Verbosity', 'Curse of Vitality', 'Custodi Lich', 'Custodi Soulbinders', 'Custodi Squire', 'Daretti, Ingenious Iconoclast', 'Deepglow Skate', 'Desperate Ritual', 'Disrupt Decorum', 'Domesticated Hydra', "Drafna's Restoration", "Dragon's Presence", 'Drown in Shapelessness', "Duelist's Heritage", 'Earth-Origin Yak', 'Earthshaking Si', 'Echo Storm', 'Edgar Markov', 'Emissary of Grudges', 'Empyrial Storm', "Enchanter's Bane", 'Endless Atlas', 'Energy Tap', 'Entourage of Trest', 'Entrapment Maneuver', 'Entreat the Dead', "Estrid's Invocation", 'Estrid, the Masked', 'Ever-Watching Threshold', 'Evolutionary Escalation', 'Expropriate', 'Faerie Artisans', 'Feiyi Snake', 'Ferocious Zheng', 'Field of Dreams', 'Fire-Omen Crane', 'Firesong and Sunspeaker', 'Flood', 'Forest', 'Forge of Heroes', 'Fortunate Few', 'Fractured Identity', 'Frenzied Fugue', 'Fury Storm', 'Galecaster Colossus', 'Game of Chaos', 'Garrulous Sycophant', 'Gempalm Incinerator', 'Genesis Storm', 'Geode Golem', 'Giant Spider', 'Goblin Goliath', 'Goblin Goon', 'Goblin Spymaster', 'Grave Upheaval', 'Grenzo, Havoc Raiser', 'Grip of Phyresis', 'Guttural Response', 'Gyrus, Waker of Corpses', 'Hammer of Nazahn', 'Hardened-Scale Armor', 'Heavenly Blademaster', 'Heavenly Qilin', 'Heirloom Blade', "Herald's Horn", 'Huang Zhong, Shu General', 'Hungry Lynx', 'Ikra Shidiqi, the Usurper', 'Immortal Phoenix', 'Inalla, Archmage Ritualist', 'Inspired Sphinx', 'Ishai, Ojutai Dragonspeaker', 'Island', 'Isolated Watchtower', 'Izzet Chemister', 'Jhoira of the Ghitu', 'Jiang Yanggu', 'Journey for the Elixir', 'Kaya, Ghost Assassin', 'Keeper of Keys', 'Kess, Dissident Mage', 'Kestia, the Cultivator', 'Kheru Mind-Eater', 'Kindred Boon', 'Kindred Charge', 'Kindred Discovery', 'Kindred Dominance', 'Kindred Summons', "Kraum, Ludevic's Opus", 'Kydele, Chosen of Kruphix', 'Kynaios and Tiro of Meletis', 'Lady Sun', 'Lady Zhurong, Warrior Queen', 'Leopard-Spotted Jiao', 'Leovold, Emissary of Trest', 'Licia, Sanguine Tribune', 'Lonely Sandbar', 'Lord Windgrace', 'Lovisa Coldeyes', 'Loyal Apprentice', 'Loyal Drake', 'Loyal Guardian', 'Loyal Subordinate', 'Loyal Unicorn', 'Lu Su, Wu Advisor', 'Ludevic, Necro-Alchemist', 'Ma Chao, Western Warrior', 'Magus of the Balance', 'Magus of the Mind', 'Magus of the Will', "Marchesa's Decree", 'Master of Waves', 'Mathas, Fiend Seeker', 'Meandering River', 'Metamorphosis', 'Migratory Route', 'Militant Angel', 'Mirri, Weatherlight Duelist', 'Mirror of the Forebears', 'Moon-Eating Dog', 'Mountain', 'Mu Yanling', 'Myth Unbound', 'Nazahn, Revered Bladesmith', 'Nesting Dragon', 'Night Incarnate', 'Nine-Tail White Fox', "Nylea's Colossus", 'O-Kagachi, Vengeful Kami', 'Octopus Umbra', 'Orzhov Advokist', 'Palace Jailer', 'Palace Sentinels', 'Pang Tong, "Young Phoenix"', 'Parting Thoughts', 'Pat