 number of 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens equal to the number of opponents you have.\\n{3}{R}, {T}: If a source you control would deal damage to an opponent this turn, it deals double that damage to that player instead.', "When Keeper of Keys enters the battlefield, you become the monarch.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you're the monarch, creatures you control can't be blocked this turn.", "When Marchesa's Decree enters the battlefield, you become the monarch.\\nWhenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, that creature's controller loses 1 life.", 'When Nazahn, Revered Bladesmith enters the battlefield, search your library for an Equipment card and reveal it. If you reveal a card named Hammer of Nazahn this way, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put that card into your hand. Then shuffle.\\nWhenever an equipped creature you control attacks, you may tap target creature defending player controls.', 'When Palace Jailer enters the battlefield, you become the monarch.\\nWhen Palace Jailer enters the battlefield, exile target creature an opponent controls until an opponent becomes the monarch.', 'When Palace Sentinels enters the battlefield, you become the monarch.', 'When Plant Elemental enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice a Forest.', 'When Protector of the Crown enters the battlefield, you become the monarch.\\nAll damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to Protector of the Crown instead.', 'When Purple-Crystal Crab dies, draw a card.', 'When Recruiter of the Guard enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card with toughness 2 or less, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Stalking Leonin enters the battlefield, secretly choose an opponent.\\nReveal the player you chose: Exile target creature that's attacking you if it's controlled by the chosen player. Activate only once.", 'When Tidal Courier enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Merfolk cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\\n{3}{U}: Tidal Courier gains flying until end of turn.', "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game. You may choose new targets for the copies.\\nCopy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game. You may choose new targets for the copies.\\nCreate a token that's a copy of target artifact.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game.\\nCreate a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game.\\nEach opponent sacrifices a creature. Each opponent who can't loses half their life, rounded up.", "When you cast this spell, copy it for each time you've cast your commander from the command zone this game.\\nReveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland permanent card. You may put that card onto the battlefield. Then put all cards revealed this way that weren't put onto the battlefield on the bottom of your library in a random order.", "Whenever Armory Automaton enters the battlefield or attacks, you may attach any number of target Equipment to it. (Control of the Equipment doesn't change.)", 'Whenever Bruse Tarl, Boorish Herder enters the battlefield or attacks, target creature you control gains double strike and lifelink until end of turn.\\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)', 'Whenever Hammer of Nazahn or another Equipment enters the battlefield under your control, you may attach that Equipment to target creature you control.\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+0 and has indestructible.\\nEquip {4}', 'Whenever Nine-Tail White Fox deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', 'Whenever Pit Scorpion deals damage to a player, that player gets a poison counter. (A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game.)', 'Whenever Reckless Pangolin attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Whenever Varchild, Betrayer of Kjeldor deals combat damage to a player, that player creates that many 1/1 red Survivor creature tokens.\\nSurvivors your opponents control can't block, and they can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.\\nWhen Varchild leaves the battlefield, gain control of all Survivors.", "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, choose one —\\n• Goad target creature that player controls.\\n• Exile the top card of that player's library. Until end of turn, you may cast that card and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast that spell.", "Whenever a land enters the battlefield, Zo-Zu the Punisher deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", 'Whenever an opponent attacks, if they attacked you and/or a planeswalker you control, draw a card.', 'Whenever an opponent taps an artifact for mana, gain control of that artifact until the end of your next turn.', "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, its controller may draw a card if its power is greater than each other creature's power.\\n{G}, {T}: Add X mana in any combination of colors, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.", 'Whenever one or more creatures attack, you may have target attacking creature gain double strike until end of turn.', 'Whenever one or more land cards are put into your graveyard from anywhere, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token.\\n{G}, Sacrifice three creatures: Return target land card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Whenever you attack with one or more Zombies, draw that many cards, then discard that many cards. You gain that much life.\\n{2}, Exile two cards from your graveyard: Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Whenever you cast your first spell each turn, choose an opponent at random. Vial Smasher the Fierce deals damage equal to that spell's mana value to that player or a planeswalker that player controls.\\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)", "Xantcha, Sleeper Agent enters the battlefield under the control of an opponent of your choice.\\nXantcha attacks each combat if able and can't attack its owner or planeswalkers its owner controls.\\n{3}: Xantcha's controller loses 2 life and you draw a card. Any player may activate this ability.", 'You may have Estrid\'s Invocation enter the battlefield as a copy of an enchantment you control, except it has "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile this enchantment. If you do, return it to the battlefield under its owner\'s control."', "Your commander costs {1} less to cast for each time it's been cast from the command zone this game.\\nWhenever your commander is put into the command zone from anywhere, draw a card.", '[+1]: Create a 1/1 colorless Construct artifact creature token with defender.\\n[−1]: You may sacrifice an artifact. If you do, destroy target artifact or creature.\\n[−6]: Choose target artifact card in a graveyard or artifact on the battlefield. Create three tokens that are copies of it.', "[+1]: Create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n[+1]: The next spell you cast this turn costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control as you cast it.\\n[−7]: For each artifact you control, create a token that's a copy of it. Those tokens gain haste. Exile those tokens at the beginning of the next end step.\\nSaheeli, the Gifted can be your commander.", '[+1]: Draw a card, then put a card from your hand on top of your library.\\n[−1]: Exile another target permanent you own, then return it to the battlefield under your control.\\n[−6]: Choose left or right. Each player gains control of all nonland permanents other than Aminatou, the Fateshifter controlled by the next player in the chosen direction.\\nAminatou, the Fateshifter can be your commander.', "[+1]: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\n[−1]: If you don't control a creature named Mowu, create Mowu, a legendary 3/3 green Dog creature token.\\n[−5]: Until end of turn, target creature gains trample and gets +X/+X, where X is the number of lands you control.", '[+2]: Discard a card, then draw a card. If a land card is discarded this way, draw an additional card.\\n[−3]: Return up to two target land cards from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n[−11]: Destroy up to six target nonland permanents, then create six 2/2 green Cat Warrior creature tokens with forestwalk.\\nLord Windgrace can be your commander.', "[+2]: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.\\n[−3]: Draw two cards.\\n[−10]: Tap all creatures your opponents control. You take an extra turn after this one.", '[+2]: Untap each enchanted permanent you control.\\n[−1]: Create a white Aura enchantment token named Mask attached to another target permanent. The token has enchant permanent and totem armor.\\n[−7]: Mill seven cards. Return all non-Aura enchantment cards from your graveyard to the battlefield, then do the same for Aura cards.\\nEstrid, the Masked can be your commander.', "[0]: Exile Kaya, Ghost Assassin or up to one target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of your next upkeep. You lose 2 life.\\n[−1]: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\n[−2]: Each opponent discards a card and you draw a card.", "{2}, Exile a nonland card from your hand: Put four time counters on the exiled card. If it doesn't have suspend, it gains suspend. (At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter from that card. When the last is removed, you may cast it without paying its mana cost. If it's a creature, it has haste.)", '{2}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you control three or more lands with the same name.', '{2}{B}, {T}, Exile Magus of the Will: Until end of turn, you may play lands and cast spells from your graveyard. If a card would be put into your graveyard from anywhere this turn, exile that card instead.', '{3}: Untap Retrofitter Foundry.\\n{2}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a Servo: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Thopter: Create a 4/4 colorless Construct artifact creature token.', "{3}{B}{B}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nAs long as Sinuous Vermin is monstrous, it has menace. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", '{3}{G}, {T}: You gain 4 life. Activate only if you control a Yanggu planeswalker.', "{4}: Scry 1, then reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped. Otherwise, draw a card.\\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)", "{4}{G}{G}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Splitting Slime becomes monstrous, create a token that's a copy of Splitting Slime. (The token has no counters and isn't monstrous.)", '{4}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Magus of the Balance: Each player chooses a number of lands they control equal to the number of lands controlled by the player who controls the fewest, then sacrifices the rest. Players discard cards and sacrifice creatures the same way.', "{6}{U}: Monstrosity 4. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put four +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nAs long as Skittering Crustacean is monstrous, it has hexproof. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "{T}: Add {C} for each card you've drawn this turn.\\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)", '{T}: Add {C}.\\nBasic landcycling {1} ({1}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1, then you may reveal the top card of your library. If a basic land card is revealed this way, put it onto the battlefield tapped. Activate only if an opponent controls at least two more lands than you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Throne of the High City: You become the monarch.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Choose target commander that entered the battlefield this turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on it if it's a creature and a loyalty counter on it if it's a planeswalker.", '{T}: Draw a card. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: Flip a coin. If you win the flip, destroy all nonland permanents.', "{T}: Return Lady Sun and another target creature to their owners' hands. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.", '{T}: Target creature gets +0/+2 until end of turn. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: Target creature you control gets +2/+0 until end of turn. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{U}, {T}, Sacrifice Magus of the Mind: Shuffle your library, then exile the top X cards, where X is one plus the number of spells cast this turn. Until end of turn, you may play lands and cast spells from among cards exiled this way without paying their mana costs.', '{U}{U}: Tap target creature without flying.', "{X}{G}{G}{G}: Monstrosity X. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put X +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nAs long as Domesticated Hydra is monstrous, it has trample."]
flavor: ['"...Is it over?"', '"...It was Pang Tong\'s boat-connecting scheme That let Zhou Yu accomplish his great deed."', '"A man, and such a fool! I, a woman, will fight them for you."\\n—Lady Zhurong to her husband Meng Huo, before leading an army against the Shu', '"A massacre? It is a mercy we grant them. This way they won\'t freeze to death."', '"A pangolin\'s power grows with its speed. Strike when you have the chance!"\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', '"A splendid talent, admired of all men! His folly lay in serving Cao Cao\'s power."', '"All will know of your crimes."', '"And who will stop me? You?"', '"As my hands touched it, I realized that I had not found it—it had been leading me here."', '"Crackle" and "pop" are the most wondrous sounds.', '"Doves and pigeons are too subtle. When I send a message, I want it to have some teeth."\\n—Aeschel, royal diplomat', '"Even your blade knows who will triumph here."\\n—Atraxa, Praetors\' Voice', '"Everything comes with a price. Especially revolution."\\n—Grenzo, dungeon warden', '"Flee all you like. The further you run the more firmly I feel your heartbeat."', '"For reasons unknown to me, herds in the Arrow Bamboo Forest have become more and more agitated."\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', '"From the swallows, I learned how to ride the winds to anywhere, and from my tears, I mastered how to harness the water."', '"Fuses? We have more than enough! Now ... which one was it?"\\n—Flearan One-Eye, goblin engineer', '"Greed, rage, and bloodlust all lead to death at the hands of those who keep their heads."\\n—Sergeant Eyra', '"How does one become a self-taught genius? Naturally, it requires brains."', '"I give my blood, my life, all I have in exchange for victory."', '"I gladly offer my weapon and my life to the glory of my sovereign."', '"I\'ll show you what you truly desire."', '"I\'m sure we can come to an arrangement."', '"Infiltrate and infuriate!"\\n—Goblin Espionage League motto', '"Interesting . . . This mortal being seems to have been blessed with Qilin\'s essence."\\n—Mu Yanling\'s journal', '"It lives ... IT LIVES!"\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"Keeping order is a task too important to relinquish in death."\\n—Abrado, Custodi priest', '"Look what we fought for. Look what we built together."', '"Loss has no meaning here. You cannot take from those who have nothing."', '"Marchesa\'s poison is delivered by more than daggers."\\n—Adriana, Captain of the Guard', '"Mowu was wary that day, as though he sensed the danger ahead."\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', '"My liege will lead and I will follow—to the battlefield, to the grave, and beyond."', '"My master believes anything is achievable."', '"My people have always been here, and here we shall remain."', '"My sword is pledged to the defense of this city, not to the throne or this usurper."', '"No single arrow can pierce an entire flock."', '"Now the scaled ones rule Tarkir."', '"One who ruled willing subjects would need no such protection."\\n—Adriana, Captain of the Guard', '"Prepare for battle!"\\n—Jiang Yanggu', '"Rulers come and go, but my allegiance belongs to the throne."', '"Sit. Fetch. Devastate."', '"The Ancestor Dragon appeared atop the clouds, amid shattering mountains and sundering earth."\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', '"The dim resort to violence, for which the nimble prepare."\\n—Leovold, emissary of Trest', '"The veil of death hides little from our kind."', '"There is no justice when some profit and others go without."', '"These eyes have shown me the flaws of flesh."', '"These halls are sacred. You will be silent."', '"They\'re not your friends; they despise you. I\'m the only one you can count on. Trust me."', '"Those who seek my protection receive it."\\n-Nylea, god of the hunt', '"Those who seize power must have the means to hold it."\\n—Queen Marchesa', '"Those who stood in my path now lay behind me."', '"Through me, the Great Teacher\'s voice will rattle this world."', '"To spend your life seeking, only to find regret upon achieving ... this is the most delicious irony of all."\\n—Leshrac, Walker of Night', '"Virile in war, he kept the north in fear; His prodigies subdued the western sphere."', '"What was taken shall be restored."\\n—Arathel, elvish queen', '"What weapon will you bear against one who\'s mastered them all?"', '"When the herd moves, so should you."\\n—Yon Basrel, Oran-Rief survivalist', '"Where\'d all the birds go?"\\n—Kaldrin, jungle sightseer', '"You burn. I\'ll pillage."', '"You may want to hold your breath."\\n—Kellyg, merrow aquitect', '"You think they know we\'re here?"\\n—Orlo, goblin raider', '"Zendikar\'s wounds can be healed."', 'A heaven-sent vision is like a lantern to guide the way.', "A pangolin's scales are resistant to all sorts of damage and weaponry. Desire for them threatens to drive the pangolin to extinction.", 'A precious shell without, a delicious taste within.', 'A rapid and catastrophic decline.', 'A savage cry with the power to shatter minds.', "A shining symbol of Paliano's true ruler—ambition.", 'All things will crumble, whether by time or by force.', 'An inspiring and glorious ascent.', 'An organized and methodical reproduction.', 'At his behest the Kami War began to regain That Which Was Taken.', 'Before a cause can have supporters, it has to have a voice.', 'Beneath crashing waves lies an ocean of secrets waiting to be explored.', "Cao Cao's cousin, Cao Ren was known throughout the three kingdoms as the fiercest of warriors.", 'Clouds and mists cover the lake as though it were a dreamland. When the wind rises, the mists disperse, opening great vistas of rippling reeds.', 'Death arrives on tattered wings and stolen bones.', 'Death eventually wiggles toward us all.', 'Deep in the Northern Mountains, the yaks linger silently, channeling the powers of the earth.', "Dinner and politics don't mix.", 'Each scar on its hide is a badge of honor.', 'Enchanters add layer upon layer of complexity to the world around them.', 'Few things are more valuable than time or money—and Leovold has plenty of both.', 'Few things are truly "lost" at sea.', 'Fire leads to more fire.', 'Flavorful aromas beckon many a salivating maw.', 'For goblins, quantity is quality.', "For the right price, he'll unlock your path to the throne.", 'Forever after, she lived in fear of the madness reclaiming her.', 'Good health beckons many a vigorous follower.', 'Ground bones, broken glass, and splintered shipwrecks make up the sands of his shores.', 'Guarded by cartographers, disdained by warlords, coveted by adventurers.', 'He does not tolerate intruders.', 'Her bold movements are anchored in the careful precision of each rope.', 'History is not delicately woven. It is hammered with fire.', 'Idle chatter becons many an attentive ear.', 'If bribery and intimidation fail, Marchesa turns to her favorite form of bureaucracy.', "If you can see it clearly, you're already on fire.", 'In the end, the lights fade, the land withers, and only the dead and vile remain.', 'Inscribed with runes that predate the dragon, its horns possess their own ancient magic.', 'It has waited a millennium just for you, and for a millennium will it watch over your descendants.', 'It is ancient, immense, and irresistible.', 'It is said that Yinglong gave birth to the qilin and the phoenix, and after them, all the hairy and winged beings in the world. Thus it is known as the Ancestor Dragon.', 'It stops flying only as its life comes to an end.', 'It strides through the universe as though stepping on the stars, crossing freely between the celestial and earthly worlds.', 'Its graceful glide paints the ocean floor with strokes of luminescence.', 'Its wings are a heavenly inferno that sets the world ablaze.', 'Jingling coins beckon many an eager hand.', 'Known for their glowing horn and stone-rattling roar, zheng are the fiercest predators in the forest. Few survived before Jiang Yanggu came.', "Lu Su served as an intermediary between the Wu and Shu kingdoms until Zhou Yu's death in 210, when he became Wu's supreme commander.", 'Mystery lies beneath the haunting mists. Never stay where obscurity deepens.', 'Near the Western Seas lies Mount Zhaoyao—a forest of stones that reaches the clouds, a bountiful land of wondrous treasures and strange animals.', 'No duelist is without equal in Paliano.', 'Not all enormous beasts are quick to anger.', 'Not all who remember Urza do so with fondness.', "Not even the tallest tree stands a chance against the underside of a dinosaur's foot.", "Once a fierce foe, she would become one of Madara's greatest protectors.", 'Self-reflection is not without its perils.', 'She bears the greatest burden of all: that of knowing.', 'She spins a web few can resist. Its sweet aroma sparks chaos in every heart.', 'She talks using riddles her disciples alone can unravel.', 'Sima Yi fought for four generations of the Cao family before his own grandson became emperor and united the three kingdoms.', 'Sister to Sun Quan and wife to Liu Bei, Lady Sun often felt her loyalty to both tested.', 'Sometimes the smallest nuisance can be the greatest pain.', 'Sounds of life beckon many a restless soul.', 'Spilled blood always begets more of the same.', 'Survival is a constant competition from which both sides can benefit.', 'The Law of Givesies Backsies is respected by every noble pursuer of shiny things.', 'The Orzhov care not for repentance, only repayment.', 'The best techniques outlive their creators.', 'The earth shook in support of their cause, offering a champion of its own.', "The finest soldiers aren't worth a whit without a set of hands to lead them and a set of eyes to guide them.", 'The justice of dragons demands more than just an eye for an eye.', 'The market is now closed.', "The more you pay for the lesson, the better you'll remember it.", 'The most nimble of creatures, it chases the most sacred luminence.', 'The pale deer are believed to have lived a thousand years, the pure white five hundred more. Those who seek them would gladly wander the wilds forever for the merest glimpse of these sacred beings.', 'The peaks of Hurloon never fall silent.', "The pounding of his followers' hearts matched the beat of his hooves, and their voices echoed his bellows.", "The rainbow seen above the Great Lake of Cloud Dream just after the rain is nothing but the vivid-colored flying fishes' ritual dance.", 'The rumors are horrifying; the truth is worse.', 'The spirits of all the rivers and oceans came together as an unstoppable force, unleashing their fury as lightning and thunder.', 'The welcoming appearance of the Arrow Bamboo Forest masks its deathly hostility.', 'Their fires burn quietly, allowing the phoenixes to glide silently through the canyon.', 'There are precious few names that echo throughout the Multiverse.', 'There is always a rabble to be roused.', 'These nimble sparrows, not often seen, delight in tricking the pangolins that wander the forest.', 'This strange beast has the hide of a leopard, the howl of a dog, and the horns of an ox.', 'Those who fail to respect power will soon be consumed by it.', 'Those with knowledge are wise to listen to those with imagination.', 'Two bodies, twice the malice.', "With no flesh to tire or resolve to falter, the machines soon became the Academy's preferred trainers.", 'With such great footsteps, everything is within walking distance.', "Zombies work best when they're fed appropriately, so it's prudent to let them eat on the job."]
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Alayna Danner', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Alex Konstad', 'Alexander Forssberg', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Babyson Chen & Uzhen Lin', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Bayard Wu', 'Ben Wootten', 'Bram Sels', 'Carmen Sinek', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Burdett', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'David Gaillet', 'David Palumbo', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Even Amundsen', 'Filip Burburan', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'G-host Lee', 'Gaga Zeng', 'Gao Yan', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Howard Lyon', 'Ian Miller', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Ioan Dumitrescu', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wei', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'Janine Johnston', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Kang', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Junko Taguchi', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Karla Ortiz', 'Kee Lo', 'Keith Parkinson', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Koji', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Li Tie', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Winters', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'McLean Kendree', 'Miao Aili', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Burns', 'Mitchell Malloy', 'Noah Bradley', 'Pon Lee', 'Qiu De En', 'Quan Xuejun', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Ravenna Tran', "Rick O'Brien", 'Robbie Trevino', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Burley', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Shinchuen Chen', 'Shreya Shetty', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stanton Feng', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Tan Yan Yao', 'Ted Naifeh', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas Gianni', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Tingting Yeh', 'Titus Lunter', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tommy Arnold', 'Tony Foti', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wang Yuqun', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Wolk Sheep', 'Xin-Yu Liu', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Yutaka Li', 'Zack Stella', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zhao Tan', 'Zoltan Boros', '林玄泰']
